^{:go/end 49} (go/method Write "Write implements the standard write interface.  If the last characters are\nnot at a normalization boundary, the bytes will be buffered for the next\nwrite. The remaining bytes will be written on close.\n" [^{:tag (* normWriter)} w ^{:tag (slice byte)} data] :results [^int n ^error err]
